File":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.media-budget"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"topics.how-this-notebook-works","id":"b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"sources.github-pages-limits","alias":"GitHub Pages limits","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":3,"offset":491},"end":{"line":12,"column":54,"offset":542},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits"}}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"8d629673-d21d-4f83-9423-4e62c68da9ab","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"how-this-notebook-works\">How this notebook works<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#how-this-notebook-works\"></a></h1>\n<p>Most public notebooks die of one of two causes: the structure gets so\nelaborate that filing a thought costs more than thinking it, or there's no\nstructure at all and the archive turns into a pile. This one aims at the\nnarrow band between those.</p>\n<p>Three kinds of note, one rule for choosing between them:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25\">Three kinds of page, and one rule for choosing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d\">Naming and linking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626\">A budget for images and video</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a\">GitHub Pages limits</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dendron builds the reverse of this list automatically — open any note above\nand its <strong>Backlinks</strong> panel will point back here.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">writing-system (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","title":"Notes","desc":"Ideas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"notes","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"1684a548ea270e4f1afc2c89cb1e47c9","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes","id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"from":{"fname":"root","id":"03cdc22b-eff8-4e94-bd04-96724d382caa","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":3,"offset":106},"end":{"line":5,"column":18,"offset":121},"indent":[]},"value":"notes"}],"anchors":{},"children":["d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3","b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nIdeas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once. Every\nnote filed under this hierarchy shows up as a child below, and Dendron's\nbacklinks panel shows what links into each one.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":1,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavi